---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-border-paper bg-canvas transition-colors duration-200 py-10">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-serif text-ink-muted">
    <!-- Quote & Philosophy -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-seal/60"></span>
      <p class="tracking-widest">
        「疏影横斜水清浅，暗香浮动月黄昏」
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright & Links -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-ink-muted font-sans text-[11px]">
      <span>© {currentYear} Yuki-Nova</span>
      <span class="opacity-40">·</span>
      <span>Paper & Ink System</span>
      <span class="opacity-40">·</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/Yuki-Nova" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
